# API (@jkbalaji/api)

- ESM NestJS 12; Prisma client under `src/generated/prisma/`.
- New features: add a module under `src/modules/<name>/` (controller, service, DTOs).
- Run focused checks: `npm run typecheck:api`, `npm run test:api` from repo root.
- Do not run `db:migrate:deploy` or production seeds unless explicitly requested.
